(Sodick AQ600L)
(SODICK LN2W WORDS - NOT VERIFIED ON A CONTROL - CHECK BEFORE CUTTING)
(PROGRAM IS IN MM - NO G20 OR G21 IS WRITTEN - THE CONTROL UNIT SETTING MUST BE MM)
(T91 THREADS THE WIRE AT EACH START POINT)
(WORK OFFSET SET AT THE CONTROL - NO G92 IS WRITTEN)
(Z0. FOLLOWS EACH MOVE TO A START POINT - SET Z0 AT THE UPPER HEAD HEIGHT ABOVE THE PART BEFORE START)
(T94 SUBMERGED MACHINING AFTER THREADING - NO FILL OR DRAIN WORD IS WRITTEN - CHECK THE TANK IS FULL)
(T84 HIGH-PRESSURE FLUSHING AFTER THREADING)
(T85 LOW-PRESSURE FLUSHING BEFORE EACH SKIM PASS)
(WIRE OFFSET G41 G42 IS USED IN EACH SECTION THAT NAMES AN H REGISTER - SET EACH H REGISTER AT THE CONTROL BEFORE START - A SECTION WITHOUT ONE IS A WIRE-CENTRE PATH)
(EACH C CONDITION NAMED BELOW MUST EXIST IN THE CONTROL CONDITION TABLE BEFORE START)
G90
(Cut1 - Wire Contour)
(WIRE OFFSET G41 G42 IN THIS SECTION - THE PATH IS THE PART CONTOUR WITHOUT THE KERF)
(SIDE DIE - THE CONTROL WIRE OFFSET SETS THE KERF)
(CONDITION C001 MUST EXIST IN THE CONTROL CONDITION TABLE - CHECK ITS VALUES)
(WARNING CONDITION C001 IS AN EXAMPLE ROW - THE MACHINE FILE GAP 0.040 MM IS NOT IN THE PATH - THE H REGISTER AT THE CONTROL SETS THE KERF)
G54
G00 X0. Y0. U0. V0.
Z0.
T91
T84
T94
C001
(WIRE OFFSET H001 WITH CONDITION C001 - THE PATH IS THE PART CONTOUR, NOT THE WIRE CENTRE - SET H001 AT THE CONTROL TO THE WIRE RADIUS PLUS THE GAP - THE STREAM STATES 0.165 MM)
G41 H001
G01 X5. Y0.
G01 X5. Y5.
G01 X-5. Y5.
G01 X-5. Y-5.
G01 X5. Y-5.
G01 X5. Y0.
